# Why this project?
During my internship I worked on an mobile escape game which uses an LLM to bring more variety in a characters text response. 

The two biggest impacts of the project were: 
-developing six web pages for that game, evoke my interest in UI/UX design
-taking it further to a visual-heavier UI/UX design of an LLM based mechanic in a game: using a text prompt to craft new things and generate fitting sprites on scratch. 

What made this idea super interesting to me was the need of adjustable UI/UX design for non-deterministic output.

That's where the game design started. 


